  "configuration_id": "config_029",  
  "reason": "The existing evidence shows config_027 (0.724989 accuracy) is the best so far, but it uses scvi_n200 and imagenet_vit_l. config_029 uses pca_n2000 (potentially richer RNA features) and imagenet_vit_l, with aggregation None and fusion weighted. This tests whether larger RNA representations (pca_n2000) can match or exceed config_027's accuracy while keeping cost manageable (estimated ~8 GPU hours). It balances exploration of RNA encoder size and exploitation of strong image encoders, maximizing accuracy potential with minimal remaining budget."  
}

